@ApiService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5301

### Authorize a payment
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantId": "alpine-ski-house",
  "amount": 184.20,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "cardBrand": "Visa"
}

### Recent payments, newest first
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/payments?limit=10
Accept: application/json

### A single payment (use an ID from the previous response)
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/payments/pay_3f9a1c7e5b2d4f60
Accept: application/json

### Merchants
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/merchants
Accept: application/json

### Gateway status for the status page
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/status
Accept: application/json

### 400 validation problem details
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/problem+json

{
  "merchantId": "unknown-merchant",
  "amount": 0.10,
  "currency": "USD",
  "cardBrand": "Amex"
}

### Simulate a card processor outage (development only), then authorize a payment to get a 503 problem
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/dev/dependencies/card-processor/outage

### Restore every dependency (development only)
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/dev/dependencies/restore

### Overall health: Healthy, Degraded, or Unhealthy
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/health

### OpenAPI document
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
